<title>GERMANY: EU could export 26 mln T grain in 95/96 - Toepfer.</title>
<headline>EU could export 26 mln T grain in 95/96 - Toepfer.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union grain exports in the 1996/97 season may total 26 million tonnes compared with the below average 19 million exported in 95/96, German trader Alfred C Toepfer said in a monthly market report.</p>
<p>The trader raised a December 18 estimate of 25 million tonnes for 96/97.</p>
<p>Early February 1997 export licences totalled seven million tonnes compared with 5.2 million tonnes a year earlier, Toepfer said.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
